   "title": "0868AT43A0020 868 MHz RF Chip Antenna",
   "partNumber": "0868AT43A0020001E (legacy 0868AT43A0020)",
   "manufacturer": "Johanson Technology",
   "category": "Antenna (chip, sub-GHz)",
   "summary": "7 × 2 mm LTCC ceramic chip antenna for the 868 MHz SRD band (858–878 MHz, ≥9.5 dB return loss), with −2.5 dBi peak / −6 dBi average gain and ~26 % radiated efficiency on Johanson's 40 × 20 mm evaluation board. It must sit at a PCB end or corner over a ground clearance with a pi matching network (3.9 pF / 18 nH / 0.3 pF on the EVB; your board will need retuning). Pairs with sub-GHz transceivers such as the CC1101: use the link calculator to check ERP against the SRD limit and to estimate range.",
   "revision": "Doc# 36S00210 Revision 2.0 (2023)"
  },
