    "notes": "Polar scale: rings at −30/−20/−10/0 dB, outer ring +10 dB; total gain (single trace per cut). The plot is labelled 'dB'; treated as dBi since the peak (≈−1.4 dB) agrees with the −2.5 dBi typ. peak gain. Digitized with pixel tracing at 5° steps (XZ: two angles missing at sharp steps)."
